WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:35.709 --> 00:01:38.610
The infinite universe... The final frontier.

00:01:40.313 --> 00:01:44.010
But someone is now disturbing
the peace of the universe!

00:01:50.524 --> 00:01:52.192
Hold it right there!

00:01:52.192 --> 00:01:52.592
"Spa-Po"

00:01:52.592 --> 00:01:56.496
"Spa-Po"
Space Police Policeman! This is the
name of the space police organization

00:01:56.496 --> 00:01:59.900
"Spa-Po"
whose HQ lies on the distant
planet Pope near the galactic core!

00:01:59.900 --> 00:02:00.161
Whose HQ lies on the distant
planet Pope near the galactic core!

00:02:02.636 --> 00:02:04.467
"Spa-Po"
Policemen!

00:02:06.239 --> 00:02:08.104
Policemen!

00:02:09.276 --> 00:02:10.177
Policemen!

00:02:10.177 --> 00:02:10.710
"Spa-Po"

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:10.744
"Spa-Po"

00:02:10.744 --> 00:02:13.647
"Spa-Po"
Today, Space Police Policeman
continues their fight against

00:02:13.647 --> 00:02:16.850
"Spa-Po"
the evil group Wargon, which
is disturbing the peace of Earth!

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:17.316
The evil group Wargon, which
is disturbing the peace of Earth!

00:02:18.952 --> 00:02:20.821
Awesome!

00:02:20.821 --> 00:02:24.224
What're you watching?! We're on patrol!

00:02:24.224 --> 00:02:27.961
"Fear! The Drill Worm Bazooka Man!"

00:02:27.961 --> 00:02:31.064
You're watching
"Policeman" on the job again?

00:02:31.064 --> 00:02:32.432
But he's so cool!

00:02:32.432 --> 00:02:34.901
They shouldn't have scheduled
us for patrol while it's on!

00:02:34.901 --> 00:02:36.670
- Yeah, yeah.
- Hey, Wargon! Don't you plant
another bomb on a kindergarten bus!

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:38.071
- Hey, Wargon! Don't you plant
another bomb on a kindergarten bus!

00:02:38.071 --> 00:02:40.140
- Space police, huh?
- Hey, Wargon! Don't you plant
another bomb on a kindergarten bus!

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:42.404
They're just ripping off the Galaxy Police...

00:02:44.411 --> 00:02:47.781
They called me the
Star of the Galaxy Police...

00:02:47.781 --> 00:02:52.819
How come I'm stuck as a resident
officer on this backwater planet?

00:02:52.819 --> 00:02:54.988
Everything... All of it is...

00:02:54.988 --> 00:02:56.512
There he is!

00:02:57.924 --> 00:03:01.928
Hurry up with that bomb! Move it!

00:03:01.928 --> 00:03:03.663
Hold it right there!

00:03:03.663 --> 00:03:05.358
What the...?

00:03:05.665 --> 00:03:08.702
One! Defeat the bad guy!

00:03:08.702 --> 00:03:11.705
Two! Our distant home planet!

00:03:11.705 --> 00:03:14.274
Three! House searches all together!

00:03:14.274 --> 00:03:17.511
Four! Pleased to meet you! Space Police...

00:03:17.511 --> 00:03:18.912
...Policeman!

00:03:18.912 --> 00:03:20.714
I'm sorry to interrupt your fun.

00:03:20.714 --> 00:03:23.383
Oh, just when it was getting good!

00:03:23.383 --> 00:03:26.720
I want you to run a tight
patrol, and no watching TV!

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:28.455
It's time for your regular report.

00:03:28.455 --> 00:03:31.525
Is there anything unusual
to report in the Sol System?

00:03:31.525 --> 00:03:33.727
It sure is busy at headquarters...

00:03:33.727 --> 00:03:34.794
Did you say something?

00:03:34.794 --> 00:03:36.887
No, Sir. Nothing at all.

00:03:37.998 --> 00:03:41.401
Detectives First Grade Mihoshi
and Kiyone, make your regular report.

00:03:41.401 --> 00:03:46.406
Yes, Sir! Wargon is planting a
time bomb on a kindergarten bus!

00:03:46.406 --> 00:03:49.409
I know, I know!
What's the status of your patrol?

00:03:49.409 --> 00:03:51.778
Nothing unusual to report, Sir.

00:03:51.778 --> 00:03:55.282
I don't mind if you watch Earth TV,
but pay attention on patrol, as well!

00:03:55.282 --> 00:03:56.683
- Yes, Sir!
- Yes, Sir!

00:03:56.683 --> 00:03:59.319
Purple Policeman!

00:03:59.319 --> 00:04:02.982
It's Purple Policeman!

00:04:04.624 --> 00:04:06.359
Soon...

00:04:06.359 --> 00:04:08.795
I wanna go back to headquarters soon...

00:04:08.795 --> 00:04:11.698
Let's all work together! Space Police!

00:04:11.698 --> 00:04:13.461
Policeman!

00:04:18.705 --> 00:04:20.106
And now...

00:04:20.106 --> 00:04:22.939
Give us some more delicious browned rice!

00:04:32.185 --> 00:04:35.086
Ryo-Ohki! No sneaking bites to eat!

00:04:41.528 --> 00:04:44.019
What're you doing, Ryo-Ohki?

00:04:46.032 --> 00:04:51.771
It's dangerous in the
kitchen, so go someplace else!

00:04:51.771 --> 00:04:55.475
The Kaminari rice cakes Tenchi sent...

00:04:55.475 --> 00:04:58.478
The person who will get the last one...

00:04:58.478 --> 00:05:00.105
- Is me!
- Will be me!

00:05:01.281 --> 00:05:05.085
Why should you get it? You've already had 25!

00:05:05.085 --> 00:05:11.424
You've eaten 22, Ryoko, but
you've put another <i>3 in your pocket!</i>

00:05:11.424 --> 00:05:13.824
So we've each had the same number.

00:05:14.995 --> 00:05:17.297
To get one more means...

00:05:17.297 --> 00:05:20.425
<i>...I'll</i> have more of Tenchi's love!
<i>...I'll</i> have more of Lord Tenchi's love!

00:05:21.101 --> 00:05:23.729
- Let's fight for it!
- Let's fight for it!

00:05:33.246 --> 00:05:34.547
You're in trouble!

00:05:34.547 --> 00:05:36.515
You're wide open!

00:05:41.821 --> 00:05:44.691
- Now we've gone and done it...
- Now we've gone and done it...

00:05:44.691 --> 00:05:45.725
- This is all your fault!
- This is all your fault!

00:05:45.725 --> 00:05:47.852
- See if I care!
- See if I care!

00:05:49.763 --> 00:05:51.731
- But for the time being...
- But for the time being...

00:05:51.731 --> 00:05:54.359
- Let's try to stick it together...
- Let's try to stick it together...

00:06:23.463 --> 00:06:26.557
Ryo-Ohki! What did you do to
Grandpa Masaki's Buddha statue?!

00:06:27.367 --> 00:06:30.136
What? You didn't do it?

00:06:30.136 --> 00:06:31.971
Really?

00:06:31.971 --> 00:06:34.574
Would you look at that?

00:06:34.574 --> 00:06:39.679
We saw Ryo-Ohki break the
Buddha statue clean in half!

00:06:39.679 --> 00:06:40.647
Right?

00:06:40.647 --> 00:06:43.083
Y-Yes, I saw it! I saw it, all right!

00:06:43.083 --> 00:06:44.684
Ryo-Ohki!

00:06:44.684 --> 00:06:48.922
First you make two big messes,
and now you're lying about it!

00:06:48.922 --> 00:06:51.758
Ryo-Ohki! Tell the truth!

00:06:51.758 --> 00:06:53.726
I can't stand liars!

00:06:55.128 --> 00:06:56.561
Ryo-Ohki!

00:06:57.931 --> 00:06:59.455
Ryo-Ohki!

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:08.632
Ryo-Ohki!

00:07:10.043 --> 00:07:13.774
Ryo-Ohki!

00:07:23.490 --> 00:07:25.219
Ryo-Ohki...

00:07:27.427 --> 00:07:29.963
I'm home.

00:07:29.963 --> 00:07:31.931
Grandpa Masaki, I'm sorry!

00:07:31.931 --> 00:07:33.133
Ryo-Ohki...

00:07:33.133 --> 00:07:35.795
What? Ryo-Ohki?

00:07:36.636 --> 00:07:40.640
What?! It wasn't Ryo-Ohki
that broke the statue?

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:46.346
No. Ryo-Ohki couldn't have produced
such power to make this clean cut.

00:07:46.346 --> 00:07:51.985
I was asked to appraise its
value as a solid-gold statue.

00:07:51.985 --> 00:07:55.722
But thanks to this,
I now know that it's just gold leaf.

00:07:55.722 --> 00:07:59.659
Well, well... So they
should really be thanking us.

00:07:59.659 --> 00:08:02.162
I don't think so!

00:08:02.162 --> 00:08:03.596
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:08:03.596 --> 00:08:06.466
Ryo-Ohki, I'm sorry...

00:08:06.466 --> 00:08:10.300
Please... Come home soon...

00:08:22.048 --> 00:08:24.778
It's dangerous in the kitchen,
so go somewhere else!

00:08:26.052 --> 00:08:29.989
First you break things twice,
and now you're lying about it!

00:08:29.989 --> 00:08:31.524
Tell the truth!

00:08:31.524 --> 00:08:34.294
I can't stand liars!

00:08:34.294 --> 00:08:37.163
Ryo-Ohki! Ryo-Ohki!

00:08:37.163 --> 00:08:38.892
Ryo-Ohki!

00:09:58.244 --> 00:10:01.314
Now Ryo-Ohki won't leave the Moon.

00:10:01.314 --> 00:10:05.084
That creature is a
member of the family, as well.

00:10:05.084 --> 00:10:07.917
I'm counting on you, Yu-Ohki.

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:20.366
It's been three days now...

00:10:20.366 --> 00:10:22.527
Goodbye.

00:10:26.239 --> 00:10:28.908
I wonder when she'll come back to school?

00:10:28.908 --> 00:10:31.945
Hey, you! The boy lost
in thought down there!

00:10:31.945 --> 00:10:34.013
Hold it right there!

00:10:34.013 --> 00:10:35.281
Yoo-hoo!

00:10:35.281 --> 00:10:36.916
Mihoshi? Kiyone?

00:10:36.916 --> 00:10:39.452
Tenchi, we've got an emergency! Get in!

00:10:39.452 --> 00:10:41.477
Beam him up!

00:10:44.857 --> 00:10:48.261
Let's work together! Let's go, Policeman!

00:10:48.261 --> 00:10:50.092
- Go, go!
- Go, go!

00:11:01.040 --> 00:11:03.142
Ayeka, you jerk!

00:11:03.142 --> 00:11:09.682
Hey, she's a jerk, all right, but
kid sisters shouldn't talk like that.

00:11:09.682 --> 00:11:13.987
What're you saying?!
This is your fault, too, Ryoko!

00:11:13.987 --> 00:11:15.788
I'm sorry, Sasami.

00:11:15.788 --> 00:11:20.426
It's my fault for being wheedled
by that stupid, mean Ryoko.

00:11:20.426 --> 00:11:24.130
What?! So it's my fault, is it?

00:11:24.130 --> 00:11:25.732
Ryo-Ohki!

00:11:25.732 --> 00:11:28.167
Wait a minute!

00:11:28.167 --> 00:11:30.397
Calm down, all right?

00:11:33.773 --> 00:11:37.677
It's been like this since we
got back from patrol yesterday.

00:11:37.677 --> 00:11:42.910
My deductions tell me that
this is the work of Wargon!

00:11:48.554 --> 00:11:53.593
If I'd have had more faith in Ryo-Ohki,
this wouldn't have happened...

00:11:53.593 --> 00:11:57.463
It'll be okay, Sasami.
I'm sure Ryo-Ohki will come back.

00:11:57.463 --> 00:12:01.968
But Ryo-Ohki's never missed dinner before!

00:12:01.968 --> 00:12:04.637
It's okay, Ryo-Ohki will turn up soon enough.

00:12:04.637 --> 00:12:08.674
She's right. Ryo-ohki is hungry all
the time, just like someone we know.

00:12:08.674 --> 00:12:09.976
Hey, wait a minute!

00:12:09.976 --> 00:12:13.212
You mean me, don't you?!

00:12:13.212 --> 00:12:17.650
Well, well! People with a guilty
conscience certainly catch on quickly!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:20.720
Enough!

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:23.656
- All right...
- Right...

00:12:23.656 --> 00:12:27.226
Ryo-Ohki! Where did you go, Ryo-Ohki?!

00:12:27.226 --> 00:12:29.829
This is the work of Wargon, all right...

00:12:29.829 --> 00:12:34.333
I've got it! Washu always
comes through in a pinch!

00:12:34.333 --> 00:12:37.303
So you want me to find Ryo-Ohki,
who has run away, do you?

00:12:37.303 --> 00:12:40.306
Make sure you take
all this down, Mr. Watson.

00:12:40.306 --> 00:12:42.542
What're we gonna do
when we find Ryo-Ohki, Tenchi?

00:12:42.542 --> 00:12:45.011
We'll go and bring Ryo-Ohki home, of course.

00:12:45.011 --> 00:12:46.512
But...

00:12:46.512 --> 00:12:49.749
I'm the type who likes to dress the part...

00:12:49.749 --> 00:12:53.086
Ryo-Ohki might hate me now...

00:12:53.086 --> 00:12:56.689
Hey, I'm the type who likes to dress the part!

00:12:56.689 --> 00:13:01.727
No way... I'm sure Ryo-Ohki
will forgive you when you explain.

00:13:01.727 --> 00:13:05.219
I said I'm the type who
likes to dress the part!

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:07.533
"Time"

00:13:07.533 --> 00:13:10.670
"Time"
Ta-dah! This new item will save the day!

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:11.432
Ta-dah! This new item will save the day!

00:13:14.707 --> 00:13:17.910
This Time Monitor can analyze
residual brainwave patterns

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:20.879
to detect Ryo-Ohki's past activity!

00:13:22.048 --> 00:13:25.418
But I have a method of speaking
directly that doesn't involve

00:13:25.418 --> 00:13:27.887
having to track down and go see Ryo-Ohki!

00:13:27.887 --> 00:13:30.981
Ta-dah! The US-Esper pellet!

00:13:32.458 --> 00:13:35.728
Taking this will activate
100% of the neurons in the brain,

00:13:35.728 --> 00:13:37.958
allowing anyone to become an esper!

00:13:39.132 --> 00:13:43.432
However, every time you use it,
you sleep for 4 years and <i>3 months.</i>

00:13:44.837 --> 00:13:46.572
Let's go with the Time Monitor.

00:13:46.572 --> 00:13:48.665
Really? If that's what you want...

00:13:51.944 --> 00:13:55.681
Hey, this Time Monitor doesn't
look like it's monitoring much...

00:13:55.681 --> 00:13:56.582
Hey...

00:13:56.582 --> 00:13:58.751
Hey, Washu...

00:13:58.751 --> 00:13:59.852
Hey...

00:13:59.852 --> 00:14:01.717
Hey!

00:14:05.057 --> 00:14:06.752
Ryo-Ohki flew away!

00:14:07.994 --> 00:14:11.293
It would seem that
Ryo-Ohki has gone to the Moon.

00:14:12.331 --> 00:14:16.435
Hey, that's strange... It seems
like there's someone with Ryo-Ohki...

00:14:16.435 --> 00:14:17.570
Who? Who?

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:19.906
Unfortunately, it's impossible
to determine who it is.

00:14:19.906 --> 00:14:21.107
Why? Why?

00:14:21.107 --> 00:14:24.143
I've got it! Ryo-Ohki
must've been kidnapped!

00:14:24.143 --> 00:14:25.211
Kidnapped?

00:14:25.211 --> 00:14:28.281
Now I get it! Ryo-Ohki can't come back!

00:14:28.281 --> 00:14:31.050
Of course!

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:34.887
My deductions tell me
that this is the work of...

00:14:34.887 --> 00:14:36.322
Enough, already!

00:14:36.322 --> 00:14:40.960
Now's our chance! If we catch
this kidnapper, we can go back to HQ!

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:43.262
Everyone, leave this to Galaxy Police

00:14:43.262 --> 00:14:46.866
Detectives First
Grade Kiyone and Mihoshi!

00:14:46.866 --> 00:14:53.506
We'll apprehend the
criminal and save Ryo-Ohki!

00:14:53.506 --> 00:14:56.976
That's Galaxy Police Detective
First Grade Kiyone for you.

00:14:56.976 --> 00:15:00.513
To rescue Ryo-Ohki,
she'd even sacrifice herself.

00:15:00.513 --> 00:15:02.081
You're coming, too!

00:15:02.081 --> 00:15:03.382
I'm coming, too!

00:15:03.382 --> 00:15:04.884
Sasami...

00:15:04.884 --> 00:15:06.681
I'm coming, too!

00:15:07.687 --> 00:15:09.922
I guess I'll come along, too.

00:15:09.922 --> 00:15:12.625
It'll be nice to breathe the
air of space after all this time.

00:15:12.625 --> 00:15:13.960
How typical, Ryoko!

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:18.727
She's an alien, but she
still thinks there's air in space!

00:15:22.401 --> 00:15:25.471
We'll find you, Ryo-Ohki...

00:15:25.471 --> 00:15:27.406
We'll be heroes!

00:15:27.406 --> 00:15:31.010
How come you two have to come along?!

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:33.376
Enough, already!

00:15:34.046 --> 00:15:35.681
Awesome! Here we are!

00:15:35.681 --> 00:15:37.183
It's the Moon!

00:15:37.183 --> 00:15:39.252
The home of SF novels!

00:15:39.252 --> 00:15:42.221
The staging base for the invasion of Earth!

00:15:42.221 --> 00:15:46.492
And on that note,
it's time for our traditional...

00:15:46.492 --> 00:15:48.127
I really don't care, but...

00:15:48.127 --> 00:15:52.031
Why are you making us
wear these strange spacesuits?

00:15:52.031 --> 00:15:55.501
Like I said, I'm the type
who likes to dress the part!

00:15:55.501 --> 00:16:00.373
Washu, I couldn't go because
I put them over their mass limit...

00:16:00.373 --> 00:16:03.209
Do we really have to dress like this, too?

00:16:03.209 --> 00:16:06.646
The first step in an investigation is
to understand a victim's feelings

00:16:06.646 --> 00:16:09.206
by assuming that person's appearance.

00:16:11.217 --> 00:16:15.551
If I videotape myself arresting the
kidnapper and send HQ the tape...

00:16:18.591 --> 00:16:21.260
Okay, Mihoshi! Hit the "record" switch!

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:23.421
It's all set!

00:16:25.564 --> 00:16:29.035
This'll do the trick.
All that's left now is to...

00:16:29.035 --> 00:16:31.265
The investigation team has...

00:16:34.073 --> 00:16:37.610
The investigation team
has just arrived at the Moon.

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:40.313
We will now begin the
search for the kidnapper!

00:16:40.313 --> 00:16:44.483
Kiyone! Hurry up!
We're gonna leave you behind!

00:16:44.483 --> 00:16:46.474
Don't leave me behind!

00:16:47.253 --> 00:16:48.988
Oops!

00:16:48.988 --> 00:16:50.389
That's my Kiyone!

00:16:50.389 --> 00:16:51.791
Way to hustle!

00:16:51.791 --> 00:16:55.818
She's putting to good use the fact
that the gravity here is 1/6 that of Earth's!

00:16:57.963 --> 00:17:03.069
Or maybe she just tripped...

00:17:03.069 --> 00:17:05.137
Ryo-Ohki!

00:17:05.137 --> 00:17:06.798
Wait, Ryo-Ohki!

00:17:08.574 --> 00:17:10.643
Ryo-Ohki's still mad, huh?

00:17:10.643 --> 00:17:12.144
It's no surprise, I guess...

00:17:12.144 --> 00:17:15.147
Ryo-Ohki! Please, come back!

00:17:15.147 --> 00:17:17.081
Ryo-Ohki!

00:17:22.355 --> 00:17:23.823
Wh-What the...?

00:17:23.823 --> 00:17:25.424
Look at all the Ryo-Ohkis!

00:17:25.424 --> 00:17:26.759
What's going on?

00:17:26.759 --> 00:17:28.260
Wow!

00:17:28.260 --> 00:17:32.231
Oh, I get it... Ryo-Ohkis
live up here, not rabbits...

00:17:32.231 --> 00:17:34.100
Ryoko, you're unbelievable...

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:38.671
Oh, no... There's no way to tell
which one is the real Ryo-Ohki!

00:17:38.671 --> 00:17:40.106
Sasami?

00:17:40.106 --> 00:17:44.210
You can tell which is the
real Ryo-Ohki, right, Sasami?

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:45.678
How? How?

00:17:45.678 --> 00:17:48.514
Don't worry about it! Sasami can do it!

00:17:48.514 --> 00:17:51.717
B-But...

00:17:51.717 --> 00:17:52.685
Sister...

00:17:52.685 --> 00:17:54.744
Go ahead, Sasami.

00:17:57.857 --> 00:17:59.347
Right.

00:18:08.667 --> 00:18:12.238
Sasami, fight!

00:18:12.238 --> 00:18:17.309
I'm sorry, Ryo-Ohki... I got mad at you,
but you didn't do anything wrong.

00:18:17.309 --> 00:18:20.972
So please... Come back.

00:18:32.191 --> 00:18:33.681
Ryo-Ohki!

00:18:35.194 --> 00:18:36.262
She did it!

00:18:36.262 --> 00:18:38.264
You're amazing, Sasami!

00:18:38.264 --> 00:18:40.494
Let's go home, Ryo-Ohki!

00:18:44.703 --> 00:18:46.466
What's that?

00:19:00.252 --> 00:19:01.687
A-A monster?

00:19:01.687 --> 00:19:04.723
That bastard disguised himself as Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:04.723 --> 00:19:06.156
Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:13.666 --> 00:19:15.034
Go! Go!

00:19:15.034 --> 00:19:16.335
Now's our chance!

00:19:16.335 --> 00:19:17.136
Mihoshi!

00:19:17.136 --> 00:19:18.865
Ready!

00:19:23.476 --> 00:19:27.105
Take this! And this! And this! And this!

00:19:31.951 --> 00:19:36.589
Oops. It looked tough,
but it sure chickened out quickly...

00:19:36.589 --> 00:19:39.992
Everyone, the case has been solved!

00:19:39.992 --> 00:19:41.927
If we send in the video we made,

00:19:41.927 --> 00:19:44.663
we'll be transferred to HQ
and be promoted for sure!

00:19:44.663 --> 00:19:48.701
Look, Kiyone! It's taping
today's "Policeman" just fine!

00:19:48.701 --> 00:19:51.103
Team kick!

00:19:51.103 --> 00:19:55.508
Didn't I do great? I taped it,
just like you told me to, Kiyone!

00:19:55.508 --> 00:19:56.775
That's...

00:19:56.775 --> 00:19:59.175
That's impossible!

00:20:01.213 --> 00:20:03.647
Thank you for your effort, Yu-Ohki.

00:20:10.523 --> 00:20:13.083
Nothing's ever easy, is it?

00:20:18.063 --> 00:20:19.198
And now...

00:20:19.198 --> 00:20:22.065
Give us some more
delicious browned rice today!

00:20:29.508 --> 00:20:31.442
No, Ryo-Ohki!

00:20:33.679 --> 00:20:36.239
Here! This one's for you, Ryo-Ohki!

00:20:38.751 --> 00:20:41.720
Kiyone! Here comes the patrol ship!

00:20:47.326 --> 00:20:50.362
Detectives First Grade Mihoshi and
Kiyone! Make your scheduled report!

00:20:50.362 --> 00:20:52.731
Nothing to report today, either, Sir!

00:20:52.731 --> 00:20:54.033
Very well. Keep up the good work.

00:20:54.033 --> 00:20:55.500
Yes, Sir!

00:20:57.036 --> 00:20:59.338
My promotion...

00:20:59.338 --> 00:21:01.238
...is disappearing into the distance.

00:21:01.941 --> 00:21:03.909
My goodness!

00:21:06.946 --> 00:21:10.541
I wanna go back to headquarters!

00:21:36.642 --> 00:21:40.245
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:40.245 --> 00:21:44.149
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:44.149 --> 00:21:47.753
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.753 --> 00:21:51.690
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.690 --> 00:21:55.194
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:55.194 --> 00:21:59.164
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:59.164 --> 00:22:02.501
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:02.501 --> 00:22:06.505
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:06.505 --> 00:22:08.641
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.641 --> 00:22:10.576
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.576 --> 00:22:12.077
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:12.077 --> 00:22:17.916
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.916 --> 00:22:22.021
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:22.021 --> 00:22:25.290
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:28.827
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.827 --> 00:22:33.526
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:44.209 --> 00:22:46.478
Long time, no see! Mihoshi here!

00:22:46.478 --> 00:22:51.316
This time it's Mr. Masaki who's run
away, and he's gone to Tenchi's place?

00:22:51.316 --> 00:22:53.419
Come to think of it,
ever since Sasami got sick,

00:22:53.419 --> 00:22:57.356
it seems like Mr. Masaki's
done everything to take care of us.

00:22:57.356 --> 00:22:59.658
Maybe he's tired?

00:22:59.658 --> 00:23:01.694
Maybe it's a not a bad idea for
a father to forget about his job

00:23:01.694 --> 00:23:04.863
and spend time with his
son every once in a while, huh?

00:23:04.863 --> 00:23:10.802
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"Stupid Cupid."
